{{Top|notoc=1}}
[[File:AnakinSkywalkersPodracer-SWE.png|thumb|right|250px|The podracer was a type of repulsorcraft used for sporting purposes]]
A '''repulsorcraft''' was a vehicle that utilized a [[repulsorlift]] technology, which enabled them to move, hover and fly above a ground surface by exerting a force against [[gravity]].<ref name="SW EOSAOV (SE)">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia of Starfighters and Other Vehicles (second edition)]]''</ref> Several types of vehicles fell into this classification, including the [[Low Altitude Assault Transport/infantry]] (LAAT/i),<ref name="datagunship">{{Databank|republic-attack-gunship|Republic Attack Gunship}}</ref> [[podracer]]s,<ref name="TPM">{{Film|I}}</ref> and the [[Umbaran hover tank]].<ref name="darkness">{{TCW|Darkness on Umbara}}</ref>

